{"id":"sxM0JhXbELJlSZcl","meta":{"instanceId":""},"name":"Job Description Bias and Inclusive Language Checker","tags":[],"nodes":[{"id":"33f872a9-fe21-4683-8293-c0358845bd3d","name":"Form Trigger","type":"n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger","position":[528,400],"webhookId":"c08ae935-3dbb-4db7-aab1-0e9d66642934","parameters":{"options":{"buttonLabel":"Check My Job Description","appendAttribution":false},"formTitle":"Job Description Bias & Inclusive Language Checker","formFields":{"values":[{"fieldType":"textarea","fieldLabel":"Job Description Text","requiredField":true},{"fieldLabel":"Role Title (optional, improves accuracy)"},{"fieldLabel":"Industry (optional, e.g. Tech, Healthcare, Construction)"}]},"formDescription":"Paste a job description below. Get an inclusivity score, a gender-coding read, and every phrase that could be discouraging qualified candidates from applying, with a suggested inclusive rewrite for each one."},"typeVersion":2.2},{"id":"c817cb8d-9163-4949-a517-4d8e5b84e000","name":"Map Form Fields","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[768,400],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const item = $input.first().json;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    jdText: (item['Job Description Text'] || '').trim(),\n    roleTitle: item['Role Title (optional, improves accuracy)'] || 'Not specified',\n    industry: item['Industry (optional, e.g. Tech, Healthcare, Construction)'] || 'Not specified'\n  }\n}];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"e21c8d1a-bf88-48ca-9698-9507fe934841","name":"Long Enough?","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[992,400],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"loose"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"cond1","operator":{"type":"number","operation":"gte"},"leftValue":"={{ $json.jdText.length }}","rightValue":150}]}},"typeVersion":2.2},{"id":"b5884c87-a911-4827-ac9c-7a9fca982030","name":"Too Short - Error Response","type":"n8n-nodes-base.form","position":[1232,560],"webhookId":"b1c2d3e4-2222-4b2b-9b2b-2b3c4d5e6f02","parameters":{"operation":"completion","respondWith":"showText","responseText":"<html><body style=\"font-family:-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif;padding:60px;text-align:center;color:#111827;\"><h2>Please paste the full job description</h2><p style=\"color:#6b7280;\">Add at least a few sentences (150+ characters) covering the role and requirements so the analysis is accurate. Go back and try again.</p></body></html>"},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"3918996b-af33-4be0-893d-35e18cf2b1d9","name":"Prepare Input","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[1232,304],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const item = $input.first().json;\nlet text = item.jdText;\nlet truncated = false;\n\nif (text.length > 12000) {\n  text = text.slice(0, 12000);\n  truncated = true;\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    jdText: text,\n    roleTitle: item.roleTitle,\n    industry: item.industry,\n    truncated\n  }\n}];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"dc80bd8b-5cad-41a4-a0c7-b94f47d14926","name":"OpenAI Chat Model","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi","position":[1584,528],"parameters":{"model":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"gpt-4.1-mini"},"options":{"temperature":0.2}},"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"9daf4e3f-c8a0-4a96-8dae-c94697e0dac3","name":"Bias Report Schema","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured","position":[1776,656],"parameters":{"jsonSchemaExample":"{\n  \"inclusivity_score\": 68,\n  \"overall_summary\": \"This job description leans masculine-coded and includes a few aggressive phrases that research shows can discourage some qualified candidates from applying.\",\n  \"gender_coding\": {\n    \"lean\": \"Masculine-coded\",\n    \"masculine_words_found\": [\"competitive\",\"dominant\",\"rockstar\",\"ninja\"],\n    \"feminine_words_found\": [\"collaborative\",\"supportive\"],\n    \"note\": \"Masculine-coded words outnumber feminine-coded words roughly 3 to 1 in this text.\"\n  },\n  \"flags\": [\n    {\n      \"phrase\": \"must be a rockstar ninja developer who thrives in a competitive, high-pressure environment\",\n      \"category\": \"Gender-Coded\",\n      \"severity\": \"High\",\n      \"explanation\": \"Words like 'rockstar', 'ninja', and 'competitive' are masculine-coded and research shows they reduce application rates from women and non-binary candidates.\",\n      \"suggested_rewrite\": \"must be a skilled developer who thrives in a fast-paced, collaborative environment\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readability_note\": \"The listing is reasonably concise but the requirements section reads more like a wish list than a must-have list.\"\n}"},"typeVersion":1.3},{"id":"6d8e55b3-6b6b-4611-ab14-49f26fede65d","name":"Auto-fixing Output Parser","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserAutofixing","position":[1744,480],"parameters":{"options":{}},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"b7ca4d20-2f5f-47ba-b1c0-030ca89070fc","name":"Analyze Bias","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm","position":[1584,304],"parameters":{"text":"=You are a DEI-aware job description editor who applies the same principles as established gender-decoder research (Gaucher, Friesen & Kay) and inclusive-hiring best practices.\n\nRole title: {{ $json.roleTitle }}\nIndustry: {{ $json.industry }}\n\nAnalyze the JOB DESCRIPTION below and respond with:\n1. inclusivity_score: 0-100 (100 = highly inclusive and welcoming to all qualified candidates)\n2. overall_summary: 1-2 plain-English sentences summarizing the main issue, or confirming it reads well if there is nothing notable\n3. gender_coding: an object with lean (Masculine-coded, Feminine-coded, or Neutral), masculine_words_found (array of actual words/phrases from the text, e.g. competitive, dominant, rockstar, ninja, aggressive), feminine_words_found (array of actual words/phrases from the text, e.g. collaborative, supportive, nurturing, compassionate), and a one-sentence note\n4. flags: an array of every phrase that could discourage qualified candidates from applying. For each one include:\n   - phrase: the relevant text quoted or closely paraphrased from the job description\n   - category: one of Gender-Coded, Ageist, Ableist, Aggressive/Combative Language, Unnecessary Requirement, Culture-Fit Buzzword, Other\n   - severity: High, Medium, or Low\n   - explanation: plain-English reason this could discourage applicants\n   - suggested_rewrite: a more inclusive version of the same phrase that keeps the original meaning\n5. readability_note: one sentence on length and clarity of the requirements section\n\nRules:\n- Never invent a phrase that is not in the text\n- If the text reads as genuinely inclusive, say so in overall_summary and return a short or empty flags array\n- Do not flag legitimate, job-relevant technical or legal requirements (like a required certification) as bias\n\nJOB DESCRIPTION:\n{{ $json.jdText }}","batching":{},"messages":{"messageValues":[]},"promptType":"define","hasOutputParser":true},"typeVersion":1.7},{"id":"f5ed773f-bce5-47ad-b4a4-dfd29029cbd3","name":"Build HTML Report","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[1984,304],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const raw = $input.first().json.output;\nconst data = (raw && typeof raw === 'object') ? raw : null;\n\nif (!data || typeof data.inclusivity_score === 'undefined') {\n  const html = `<!DOCTYPE html><html><body style=\"font-family:-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif;padding:60px;text-align:center;color:#111827;\"><h2>Could not generate a report</h2><p style=\"color:#6b7280;\">The AI response could not be read. Please go back and try again.</p></body></html>`;\n  return [{ json: { html } }];\n}\n\nconst severityColor = (level) => {\n  const map = { High: '#dc2626', Medium: '#ea580c', Low: '#ca8a04' };\n  return map[level] || '#6b7280';\n};\n\nconst scoreColor = data.inclusivity_score >= 80 ? '#16a34a' : data.inclusivity_score >= 60 ? '#ca8a04' : '#dc2626';\n\nconst wordChips = (words, bg, fg) => (words && words.length)\n  ? words.map(w => `<span style=\"background:${bg};color:${fg};padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;margin-right:6px;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:6px;\">${w}</span>`).join('')\n  : '<span style=\"color:#9ca3af;font-size:13px;\">None found</span>';\n\nconst flagsHtml = (data.flags || []).map(f => `\n  <div style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-left:4px solid ${severityColor(f.severity)};border-radius:8px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:14px;background:#fff;\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px;\">\n      <span style=\"font-weight:600;color:#111827;\">${f.category}</span>\n      <span style=\"background:${severityColor(f.severity)};color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px;\">${f.severity}</span>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"color:#4b5563;font-style:italic;margin:6px 0;font-size:14px;\">\"${f.phrase}\"</p>\n    <p style=\"color:#111827;margin:6px 0;font-size:14px;\"><strong>Why it matters:</strong> ${f.explanation}</p>\n    <p style=\"color:#111827;margin:6px 0;font-size:14px;\"><strong>Try instead:</strong> ${f.suggested_rewrite}</p>\n  </div>\n`).join('');\n\nconst noFlagsHtml = `<p style=\"color:#16a34a;font-weight:600;\">No notably discouraging phrases were found in the text provided.</p>`;\n\nconst html = `\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><title>Job Description Bias Report</title></head>\n<body style=\"font-family:-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif;background:#f9fafb;margin:0;padding:32px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;\">\n    <h1 style=\"color:#111827;font-size:22px;margin-bottom:4px;\">Job Description Bias Report</h1>\n    <p style=\"color:#6b7280;font-size:13px;margin-top:0;\">AI-generated inclusive-language check, based on established gender-coding research and inclusive hiring guidance.</p>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;padding:20px;margin:20px 0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:36px;font-weight:700;color:${scoreColor};\">${data.inclusivity_score}/100</div>\n      <div>\n        <div style=\"font-weight:600;color:#111827;\">Inclusivity Score</div>\n        <div style=\"color:#4b5563;font-size:14px;\">${data.overall_summary}</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;padding:20px;margin:20px 0;\">\n      <div style=\"font-weight:600;color:#111827;margin-bottom:10px;\">Gender Coding: ${data.gender_coding.lean}</div>\n      <p style=\"color:#6b7280;font-size:13px;margin:0 0 10px 0;\">${data.gender_coding.note}</p>\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#111827;font-weight:600;\">Masculine-coded: </span>${wordChips(data.gender_coding.masculine_words_found, '#dbeafe', '#1e40af')}</div>\n      <div><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#111827;font-weight:600;\">Feminine-coded: </span>${wordChips(data.gender_coding.feminine_words_found, '#fce7f3', '#9d174d')}</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2 style=\"color:#111827;font-size:17px;\">Flagged Phrases (${(data.flags||[]).length})</h2>\n    ${(data.flags && data.flags.length) ? flagsHtml : noFlagsHtml}\n\n    <div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;padding:20px;margin:20px 0;\">\n      <div style=\"font-weight:600;color:#111827;margin-bottom:6px;\">Readability</div>\n      <p style=\"color:#4b5563;font-size:14px;margin:0;\">${data.readability_note}</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <p style=\"color:#9ca3af;font-size:12px;margin-top:30px;\">Generated by an AI inclusive-language checker. Use it as a starting point alongside your own hiring team's judgment.</p>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>`;\n\nreturn [{ json: { html } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"5af9d727-28b9-4b9b-bf13-0a5db365ca21","name":"Send Report","type":"n8n-nodes-base.form","position":[2208,304],"webhookId":"b1c2d3e4-3333-4b2b-9b2b-2b3c4d5e6f03","parameters":{"operation":"completion","respondWith":"showText","responseText":"={{ $json.html }}"},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"e2921299-218e-45a1-87f5-daca5d14b929","name":"Sticky Note - Overview","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-16,-16],"parameters":{"width":460,"height":996,"content":"This workflow checks a job description for biased or exclusionary language before it goes live. It scores overall inclusivity, reads the gender coding of the wording, and flags specific phrases that could discourage qualified candidates from applying. It is built for recruiters, hiring managers, and small HR teams who want a fast second opinion on a job post before publishing it.\n\n### How it works\n1. The Form Trigger collects the job description text, plus an optional role title and industry.\n2. Map Form Fields cleans up the raw form data into simple fields.\n3. Long Enough? checks the text has at least 150 characters before using any AI credits.\n4. Prepare Input trims very long text so it stays within model limits.\n5. Analyze Bias scores the text, detects gender coding, and lists every flagged phrase with a suggested rewrite.\n6. Build HTML Report formats the results and Send Report displays them back on the same page.\n\n### Setup steps\n1. Open node 7, OpenAI Chat Model, and connect your own OpenAI credential. You can swap it for any other chat model node if you prefer a different provider.\n2. Activate the workflow.\n3. Open the Form Trigger's production URL and submit a test job description to confirm the report appears correctly.\n\n### Customization\nAdjust the 150 character minimum in the Long Enough? node if you want a stricter or looser check. Edit the prompt in Analyze Bias to add extra flag categories for your industry."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"5f276622-1ff6-416d-91a4-2bd179076787","name":"Sticky Note - Section 1","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[496,144],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":964,"height":652,"content":"## 1. Input, Validation and Prep\nCollects the job description through a form, checks it has enough text to analyze, and trims anything too long before sending it to the AI. Short submissions get a friendly error message instead of wasting an AI call."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"1ca15f2e-6026-4051-9f76-3cdb88524e76","name":"Sticky Note - Section 2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1504,144],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":932,"height":652,"content":"## 2. AI Analysis and Report\nThe AI scores inclusivity, reads gender coding, and flags discouraging phrases with suggested rewrites. The results are turned into a formatted report and shown back on the same page."},"typeVersion":1}],"active":false,"pinData":{},"settings":{"binaryMode":"separate","executionOrder":"v1"},"versionId":"4a900ea0-9cd2-45de-861b-5f578f38278f","nodeGroups":[],"connections":{"Analyze Bias":{"main":[[{"node":"Build HTML Report","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Form Trigger":{"main":[[{"node":"Map Form Fields","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Long Enough?":{"main":[[{"node":"Prepare Input","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Too Short - Error Response","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Prepare Input":{"main":[[{"node":"Analyze Bias","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Map Form Fields":{"main":[[{"node":"Long Enough?","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Build HTML Report":{"main":[[{"node":"Send Report","type":"main","index":0}]]},"OpenAI Chat Model":{"ai_languageModel":[[{"node":"Analyze Bias","type":"ai_languageModel","index":0},{"node":"Auto-fixing Output Parser","type":"ai_languageModel","index":0}]]},"Bias Report Schema":{"ai_outputParser":[[{"node":"Auto-fixing Output Parser","type":"ai_outputParser","index":0}]]},"Auto-fixing Output Parser":{"ai_outputParser":[[{"node":"Analyze Bias","type":"ai_outputParser","index":0}]]}}}